#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: zinn-cache.php
msgid "Zinn® Cache"
msgstr "Zinn® Cache"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: zinn-cache.php
msgid "https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache"
msgstr "https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-cache"

#. Description of the plugin
#: zinn-cache.php
msgid "For sites hosted with Zinn Digital®. Controls the page cache your Zinn® server already provides — smart auto-purge on content change, a signed purge endpoint for your own tools, a Redis object-cache toggle and safe WordPress/WooCommerce exclusions. This is a cache controller, not a cache engine. Hosting elsewhere? Install Zinn® Cache Engine instead."
msgstr "Don shafukan da aka karɓi baƙoninsu a Zinn Digital®. Yana sarrafa ma'ajiyar shafi wacce uwar garkenku ta Zinn® ke bayarwa tuni — sharewa ta atomatik mai wayo lokacin da abun ciki ya canza, wani wurin ƙarshe na sharewa da aka sanya hannu don kayan aikin ku kanku, maɓallin canza abun abu na Redis da keɓewar WordPress/WooCommerce amintattu. Wannan mai sarrafa ma'ajiyar shafi ne, ba injin ma'ajiyar shafi ba. Kuna karɓar baƙoninsu a wani wuri? Sanya Zinn® Cache Engine maimakon haka."

#. Author of the plugin
#: zinn-cache.php
msgid "Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd"
msgstr "Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: zinn-cache.php
msgid "https://zinndigital.com"
msgstr "https://zinndigital.com"

#: includes/class-admin.php:104
msgid "Cache"
msgstr "Ma'ajiyar wucin gadi"

#: includes/class-admin.php:110
#: includes/class-admin.php:153
msgid "Page cache"
msgstr "Taskar shafin"

#: includes/class-admin.php:114
#: includes/class-admin.php:238
msgid "Object cache"
msgstr "Ma'ajiyar Abu"

#: includes/class-admin.php:118
msgid "Purging"
msgstr "Ana sharewa"

#: includes/class-admin.php:122
msgid "Exclusions"
msgstr "Banbance-banbance"

#: includes/class-admin.php:129
msgid "Purge everything now"
msgstr "Tsaftace komai yanzu"

#: includes/class-admin.php:130
msgid "Every cached page is discarded and will be rebuilt as visitors arrive. Continue?"
msgstr "An cire kowane shafi da aka adana a madubi kuma za a sake gina su yayin da baƙi ke zuwa. Ka ci gaba?"

#: includes/class-admin.php:147
msgid "Full-page cache"
msgstr "Caching shafi gaba ɗaya"

#: includes/class-admin.php:148
msgid "Served by LiteSpeed at the web server, before WordPress runs. This is where nearly all the speed comes from."
msgstr "LiteSpeed ce ke sarrafa shi a matsayin uwar garken yanar gizo, kafin WordPress ya fara aiki. Nan ne kusan duk saurin yake fitowa."

#: includes/class-admin.php:154
msgid "Send LiteSpeed cache-control and tag headers on cacheable pages"
msgstr "Aika da kanzon LiteSpeed da tag headers a shafukan da za a iya sanyawa a cache"

#: includes/class-admin.php:160
msgid "How long a page stays cached"
msgstr "Tsawon lokacin da shafi ke kasancewa a adana a cikin cache"

#: includes/class-admin.php:161
msgid "Seconds. A week suits most sites; a news site publishing hourly wants far less."
msgstr "Daƙiƙa. Mako ɗaya ya dace da yawancin shafuka; gidan yanar gizon labarai da ke wallafawa a kowace awa yana buƙatar kaɗan sosai."

#: includes/class-admin.php:170
msgid "How long a visitor’s browser keeps images and scripts"
msgstr "Tsawon lokacin da burauzar baƙo ke riƙe hotuna da rubutun shirin"

#: includes/class-admin.php:171
msgid "Seconds. Applies to images, CSS and JavaScript only — never to pages. Set to 0 to leave this to your host."
msgstr "Daƙiƙa. Ana amfani da shi kawai ga hotuna, CSS da JavaScript — ba ga shafuka ba. Sanya zuwa 0 don barin wannan ga mai masaukin baki na ku."

#: includes/class-admin.php:179
msgid "Signed-in visitors"
msgstr "Masu ziyara da suka shiga"

#: includes/class-admin.php:180
msgid "Never serve a cached page to a signed-in visitor"
msgstr "Kada ka taba ba da shafi da aka adana a madubi ga mai ziyara da ya shiga ciki"

#: includes/class-admin.php:181
msgid "On is the safe answer and the default. Turn it off only if you know every cached page is identical for every signed-in user — a membership site is the usual reason not to."
msgstr "On shine amintaccen amsa kuma tsohuwar siga ta asali. Kashe shi kawai idan ka san cewa kowane shafi da aka adana a madubi iri ɗaya ne ga kowane mai amfani da ya shiga - rukunin membobi shine dalilin da ya saba sa ba a yin hakan."

#: includes/class-admin.php:187
msgid "Different lifetimes for different content"
msgstr "Rayuwa daban-daban don abubuwa daban-daban"

#: includes/class-admin.php:188
msgid "For example: a shop’s product pages for an hour, while everything else stays a week."
msgstr "Misali: shafukan samfur na wani shago na tsawon awa guda, yayin da komai zai kasance na tsawon mako guda."

#: includes/class-admin.php:189
msgid "Add a rule"
msgstr "Sanya doka"

#: includes/class-admin.php:196
msgid "Content type"
msgstr "Nau'in abun ciki"

#: includes/class-admin.php:202
msgid "Seconds"
msgstr "Dakiku"

#: includes/class-admin.php:223
#: includes/class-admin.php:232
msgid "Object cache (Redis)"
msgstr "Cache na abu (Redis)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:224
msgid "Your host runs a private Redis object cache for this site and keeps it configured. There is nothing to set up here; the status at the top of this screen shows whether it is working."
msgstr "Mai masaukin gidan ku yana gudanar da cache na abu na Redis mai zaman kansa don wannan rukunin yanar gizon kuma yana kiyaye shi a daidaita. Babu abin da za a saita an nan; matsayi a saman wannan allon yana nuna ko yana aiki."

#: includes/class-admin.php:233
msgid "Caches the results of database queries. It helps most on a busy shop or a site with a lot of signed-in traffic, where the page cache cannot."
msgstr "Yana adana sakamakon binciken bayanan rumbu. Yana taimakawa sosai a kan kantin da ke da aiki sosai ko kuma wani shafi mai yawan baƙi da suka shiga, inda ma'ajiyar shafi ba za ta iya ba."

#: includes/class-admin.php:239
msgid "Install the Redis object-cache drop-in"
msgstr "Shigar da Redis object-cache drop-in"

#: includes/class-admin.php:240
msgid "Needs the phpredis extension. If it is missing, the box above this screen says so."
msgstr "Yana buƙatar ƙarin phpredis. Idan babu shi, akwatin da ke sama da wannan allo zai nuna hakan."

#: includes/class-admin.php:246
msgid "Redis host"
msgstr "Mai gida na Redis"

#: includes/class-admin.php:253
msgid "Redis port"
msgstr "Tashar Redis"

#: includes/class-admin.php:262
msgid "Redis database"
msgstr "Bayanan Redis"

#: includes/class-admin.php:263
msgid "Give each site on a shared Redis its own number, or they will clear each other’s cache."
msgstr "Ba kowace shafin da ke kan Redis da aka raba lambarta ta musamman ba, ko kuwa za su goge ma'ajiyar juna."

#: includes/class-admin.php:272
msgid "Redis username"
msgstr "Sunan mai amfani na Redis"

#: includes/class-admin.php:273
msgid "Only for a Redis server with ACL users (Redis 6 or later). Leave blank to sign in with the password alone."
msgstr "Don kawai ga uwar garke ta Redis tare da masu amfani da ACL (Redis 6 ko daga baya). Bar shi babu komai don shiga da kalmar wata kaɗai."

#: includes/class-admin.php:281
msgid "Redis password"
msgstr "Kalmar sirri ta Redis"

#: includes/class-admin.php:282
msgid "Leave blank if your Redis does not need one."
msgstr "Bar shi ba komai ba idan Redis ɗinka ba ya buƙatar ɗaya."

#: includes/class-admin.php:289
msgid "Key prefix"
msgstr "Maɓallin prefix"

#: includes/class-admin.php:290
msgid "An alternative to a separate database number when you cannot have one."
msgstr "Madadin wani keɓaɓɓen lambar bayanan sirri lokacin da ba za ka iya samun ɗaya ba."

#: includes/class-admin.php:307
msgid "Smart auto-purge"
msgstr "Tsaftacewa ta atomatik mai wayo"

#: includes/class-admin.php:308
msgid "Clear affected pages automatically when content changes"
msgstr "Share abubuwan da abin ya shafa ta atomatik lokacin da abun ciki ya sauya"

#: includes/class-admin.php:314
msgid "After updates"
msgstr "Bayan sabuntawa"

#: includes/class-admin.php:315
msgid "Clear everything after a core, plugin or theme update"
msgstr "Goge komai bayan sabunta tushe, filogin ko jigom-girma"

#: includes/class-admin.php:321
msgid "After a comment"
msgstr "Bayan sharhi"

#: includes/class-admin.php:322
msgid "Clear a post’s page when a comment on it is approved"
msgstr "Share shafin wallafa lokacin da aka amince da sharhi a kansa"

#: includes/class-admin.php:323
msgid "Turn this off on a very busy comment section, where it can clear the same page hundreds of times an hour."
msgstr "Kashe wannan a kan sashen sharhi mai yawan aiki sosai, inda zai iya share shafi guda daruruwan sau a awa daya."

#: includes/class-admin.php:338
msgid "Never cache these"
msgstr "Kar a taɓa adana waɗannan a ma'ajiya"

#: includes/class-admin.php:339
msgid "Sensible WordPress and WooCommerce defaults are always applied — cart, checkout, my-account and any signed-in session are never cached, whatever is below."
msgstr "Ana amfani da tsofaffin tsare-tsare masu ma'ana na WordPress da WooCommerce a duk lokacin da aka yi – ba a taɓa yin caching ɗin karusar sayayya (cart), wurin biya (checkout), shafi na (my-account) da kowane zama (session) da aka shiga ba, komai abin da ke ƙasa."

#: includes/class-admin.php:345
msgid "Addresses"
msgstr "Adireshi"

#: includes/class-admin.php:346
msgid "One path per line, for example <code>/basket</code>. A trailing <code>*</code> matches everything under it."
msgstr "Hanyar daya a kowane layi, misali <code>/basket</code>. Alamar <code>*</code> a ƙarshe tana dacewa da komai da ke ƙarƙashinta."

#: includes/class-admin.php:354
msgid "Query parameters"
msgstr "Ma'aunin bincike"

#: includes/class-admin.php:355
msgid "A page carrying one of these is never cached — for example a one-time preview token."
msgstr "Ba a taba yin ajiyar shafi mai dauke da daya daga cikin wadannan ba — alal misali alamar samfoti ta lokaci guda."

#: includes/class-admin.php:363
msgid "Cookies"
msgstr "Kuki"

#: includes/class-admin.php:364
msgid "A visitor carrying one of these is always served a fresh page."
msgstr "Ana ba wa baƙon da ke ɗauke da ɗayan waɗannan sabon shafi a kowane lokaci."

#: includes/class-admin.php:393
msgid "Every cached page has been discarded. They will be rebuilt as visitors arrive."
msgstr "An cire duk shafukan da aka adana a madadin (cache). Za a sake gina su yayin da masu ziyara suka isa."

#: includes/class-admin.php:419
msgid "The object cache is installed, but it is not storing anything."
msgstr "An adana abin lura a cikin cache, amma baya adana komai."

#: includes/class-admin.php:428
msgid "The page cache is on, but this server is not LiteSpeed."
msgstr "An adana shafin yana kunne, amma wannan uwar garken ba LiteSpeed ba ce."

#: includes/class-admin.php:429
msgid "The cache headers are being sent and nothing is reading them, so pages are not actually being cached. Ask your host whether LiteSpeed is available, or move to Zinn® hosting where it is standard."
msgstr "Ana aika da shugabannin ma'ajiyar (cache headers) kuma babu wanda ke karanta su, don haka ba a ajiye shukokin a cikin ma'ajiyar (cache) yadda ya kamata ba. Ka tambayi mai masaukin bako (host) ko LiteSpeed ​​yana samuwa, ko kuma ka koma wurin Zinn® mai masaukin bako inda ya zama daidai."

#: includes/class-admin.php:437
msgid "The object cache is on, but this server has no Redis support."
msgstr "An adana abubuwa yana kunne, amma wannan sabar ba ta da goyon bayan Redis."

#: includes/class-admin.php:438
msgid "The phpredis extension is not installed, so the drop-in cannot be used and WordPress is falling back to its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis."
msgstr "Ba a shigar da tsawo na phpredis ba, saboda haka ba za a iya amfani da drop-in ba kuma WordPress yana komawa zuwa ma'ajiya ta cikinsa ta in-memory cache. Tambayi ma'aikacin bakuncin yanar gizo naka don ya maida phpredis ya yi aiki."

#: includes/class-admin.php:446
msgid "Nothing is being cached."
msgstr "Ba a ajiyewa a cikin ma'ajiyar wucin gadi komai."

#: includes/class-admin.php:447
msgid "Both caches are switched off, so this plugin is not making the site any faster."
msgstr "Duka cache biyu a kashe suke, don haka wannan plugin din baya sa shafin ya zama mai sauri ba."

#: includes/class-admin.php:454
msgid "Caching is active on this site."
msgstr "Ana amfani da caching a kan wannan shafin."

#: includes/class-admin.php:489
msgid "Redis refused the username or password. Check the Redis credentials in wp-config.php or on this screen."
msgstr "Redis ya ki amincewa da sunan mai amfani ko kalmar sirri. Duba bayanan shiga na Redis a cikin wp-config.php ko a kan wannan allo."

#: includes/class-admin.php:491
msgid "Redis accepted the login but does not allow this site to store its keys. The Redis user needs permission for this site's key prefix."
msgstr "Redis ya karɓi shiga amma bai ba da izinin wannan shafin ya adana maɓallansa ba. Mai amfani da Redis na buƙatar izini don gaban maɓallin wannan shafin."

#: includes/class-admin.php:493
msgid "Redis refused the database number. Check the Redis database setting."
msgstr "Redis ta ki amincewa da lambar bayanan. Duba saitunan bayanan Redis."

#. zinn-i18n: human translation — the machine translator refused this string
#: includes/class-admin.php:495
msgid "Redis is out of memory and is refusing new data."
msgstr "Redis ya cika, ba shi da sauran wurin ajiya, kuma yana ƙin karɓar sabbin bayanai."

#: includes/class-admin.php:497
msgid "The phpredis extension is not installed, so WordPress is using its own in-memory cache. Ask your host to enable phpredis."
msgstr "Ba a sanya tsawo na phpredis ba, saboda haka WordPress na amfani da nata cache na cikin abin tunawa. Ka nemi mai masaukin yanar gizon ka ya kunna phpredis."

#: includes/class-admin.php:499
msgid "WP_REDIS_DISABLED is set in wp-config.php, so the object cache is switched off."
msgstr "An saita WP_REDIS_DISABLED a cikin wp-config.php, don haka an kashe ma'ajiyar abu."

#: includes/class-admin.php:501
msgid "The Redis server could not be reached. Check the Redis host and port, and that Redis is running."
msgstr "Ba a iya isa ga sabar ta Redis ba. Duba mai masaukin baki da tashar jiragen ruwa na Redis, da kuma cewa Redis yana aiki."

#: includes/class-admin.php:503
msgid "Redis did not return the value that was just written to it. Check the Redis server's logs."
msgstr "Redis bai dawo da darajar da aka rubuta a ciki ba yanzu. Duba rajistar uwar garken Redis."

#: includes/class-admin.php:518
msgid "Web server"
msgstr "Sabobin yanar gizo"

#: includes/class-admin.php:520
msgid "LiteSpeed — page caching available"
msgstr "LiteSpeed — akwai adana shafuka ajiya (caching)"

#: includes/class-admin.php:521
msgid "not LiteSpeed — page caching unavailable"
msgstr "ba LiteSpeed ba — ajiyar shafin ba ta da samuwa"

#: includes/class-admin.php:524
msgid "Redis support"
msgstr "Goyon bayan Redis"

#: includes/class-admin.php:526
msgid "phpredis is installed"
msgstr "an shigar da phpredis"

#: includes/class-admin.php:527
msgid "phpredis is not installed"
msgstr "ba a shigar da phpredis ba"

#: includes/class-admin.php:530
msgid "Page lifetime"
msgstr "Lokacin shafin"

#: includes/class-admin.php:605
msgid "You are not allowed to purge the cache."
msgstr "Ba ka da izinin tsaftace cache."

#: includes/class-admin.php:611
msgid "Cache purge requested."
msgstr "An nemi tsaftace cache."

#: includes/class-admin.php:639
msgid "Zinn® Cache: another object-cache drop-in is installed, so the Redis object cache is not managed by this plugin."
msgstr "Zinn® Cache: an shigar da wani rukunin raba abu na dabam, don haka wannan plugin din ba ya sarrafa maballin abu na Redis."

#: includes/class-admin.php:653
msgid "detected"
msgstr "an gano"

#: includes/class-admin.php:654
msgid "not detected"
msgstr "ba a gano ba"

#: includes/class-admin.php:658
msgid "phpredis extension missing"
msgstr "tsawaita phpredis ta ɓace"

#: includes/class-admin.php:660
msgid "installed, not storing anything"
msgstr "an shigar, ba a adana komai ba"

#: includes/class-admin.php:662
msgid "active, managed by your host"
msgstr "mai aiki, wanda mai watsa shafinka ke sarrafawa"

#: includes/class-admin.php:664
msgid "active"
msgstr "mai aiki"

#: includes/class-admin.php:666
msgid "inactive"
msgstr "mara aiki"

#: includes/class-admin.php:671
msgid "LiteSpeed cache:"
msgstr "Cache na LiteSpeed:"

#: includes/class-admin.php:673
msgid "Redis object cache:"
msgstr "Cache na abu na Redis:"

#: includes/class-object-cache.php:205
msgid "The Redis PHP extension (phpredis) is not available on this server, so the object cache cannot be enabled."
msgstr "Tsawaita PHP na Redis (phpredis) ba ya samuwa a wannan sabar, don haka ba za a iya kunna cache na abu ba."

#: includes/class-object-cache.php:212
msgid "Another object-cache drop-in is already installed. Remove it before enabling the Zinn® object cache."
msgstr "Wani matatse na adana abubuwa na musamman na abu (object-cache drop-in) an riga an shigar da shi. Cire shi kafin ka kunna Zinn® object cache."

#: includes/class-object-cache.php:224
msgid "Could not write the Redis connection configuration file."
msgstr "Ba a iya rubuta fayil ɗin saitin haɗin Redis ba."

#: includes/class-object-cache.php:232
msgid "The bundled object-cache drop-in could not be read."
msgstr "Ba a iya karanta drop-in na cache na abu da aka haɗa ba."

#: includes/class-object-cache.php:239
msgid "Could not install the object-cache drop-in into wp-content."
msgstr "Ba a iya shigar da drop-in na cache na abu cikin wp-content ba."

#: includes/class-object-cache.php:265
msgid "Could not remove the object-cache drop-in."
msgstr "Ba a iya cire drop-in na cache na abu ba."

#: includes/class-object-cache.php:360
msgid "The WordPress filesystem is not writable, so the object-cache drop-in could not be managed."
msgstr "Tsarin fayil na WordPress ba a iya rubuta shi, don haka ba a iya sarrafa drop-in na cache na abu ba."

#: includes/class-updater.php:230
msgid "See the Zinn Digital® release notes."
msgstr "Dubi bayanan fitowar Zinn Digital®."

#: includes/class-updater.php:285
msgid "The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed."
msgstr "Sabuntawar da aka sauke ta kasa wucewa binciken amincinta, don haka ba a girka ta ba."

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-fields.php:580
msgid "Stored. Type a new value to replace it."
msgstr "An adana. Buga sabon ƙima don maye gurbinsa."

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-fields.php:640
msgid "Filter this list…"
msgstr "Tace wannan jerin..."

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-fields.php:641
msgid "Filter this list"
msgstr "Tace wannan jerin"

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-fields.php:657
msgid "Nothing matches that filter."
msgstr "Babu abin da ya dace da wannan matattara."

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-fields.php:688
msgid "Add a row"
msgstr "Ƙara layin da ke sama"

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-fields.php:725
msgid "Remove this row"
msgstr "Cire wannan layin"

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-fields.php:725
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Cire"

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-ui.php:280
#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-ui.php:281
#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-ui.php:421
msgid "Zinn Digital®"
msgstr "Zinn Digital®"

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-ui.php:294
msgid "Zinn Digital® — overview"
msgstr "Zinn Digital® — taƙaitaccen bayani"

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-ui.php:295
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Bayani gaba ɗaya"

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-ui.php:383
msgid "Copied"
msgstr "An kwafi"

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-ui.php:422
msgid "Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working."
msgstr "Kowane plugin na Zinn® a wannan rukunin yanar gizon, da ko yana aiki."

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-ui.php:437
msgid "No connection is needed for this plugin."
msgstr "Ba a buƙatar haɗin intanit don wannan plugin ɗin."

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-ui.php:442
msgid "Open settings"
msgstr "Buɗe saituna"

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-ui.php:770
#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-ui.php:1331
msgid "You do not have permission to change these settings."
msgstr "Ba ka da izinin canza waɗannan saitunan."

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-ui.php:799
msgid "Settings sections"
msgstr "Sashen saituna"

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-ui.php:871
msgid "Support"
msgstr "Tallafi"

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-ui.php:929
msgid "Save changes"
msgstr "Ajiye sauye-sauye"

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-ui.php:958
msgid "Tools"
msgstr "Kayayyaki"

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-ui.php:973
msgid "Export settings"
msgstr "Fitar da saituna"

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-ui.php:976
msgid "Reset to defaults"
msgstr "Mayar da su zuwa tsoffin kaya"

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-ui.php:977
msgid "This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?"
msgstr "Wannan zai dawo da duk wani tsari na wannan plugin zuwa asalin sa. A ci gaba?"

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-ui.php:984
msgid "Diagnostics for support"
msgstr "Binciken matsaloli na tallafi"

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-ui.php:993
msgid "Import a settings file"
msgstr "Shigo da fayil ɗin saiti"

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-ui.php:995
msgid "Import"
msgstr "Shigo da kaya"

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-ui.php:997
msgid "Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site."
msgstr "Fayilolin da aka fitar ba su taɓa ƙunsar kalmomin sirri, alamomi ko maɓallan API ba — za ka buƙaci sake shigar da su a sabon shafin."

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-ui.php:1096
msgid "Settings saved."
msgstr "An adana saitunan."

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-ui.php:1143
msgid "Every setting on this plugin is back to its default."
msgstr "An kafa dukkan saitunan da ke kan wannan fagin a matsayin na asali."

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-ui.php:1186
msgid "Done."
msgstr "An gama."

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-ui.php:1190
msgid "That action is not available."
msgstr "Wancan matakin ba shi da samuwa."

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-ui.php:1257
msgid "That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin."
msgstr "Ba za a iya karanta fayil ɗin ba. Zaɓi fayil ɗin saituna da aka fitar daga wani kari na Zinn®."

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-ui.php:1265
msgid "That file is too large to be a settings export."
msgstr "Waccan fayil din yayi yawa sosai don ya zama fitar da saituna."

#: includes/class-zinn-cache-admin-ui.php:1278
msgid "That file is not a Zinn® settings export."
msgstr "Wancan fayil ba fitar da saitin Zinn® ba ne."

#. translators: %s: the plugin slug the file was exported from.
